ted":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":1366},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"7 Feb, 2018"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cI fell in love with the post-apocalyptic wasteland the story took place in. The stellar soundtrack and warm art were particular highlights that really brought the rich universe of OPUS: Rocket of Whispers alive.\u201d<br />\r\n35/40 \u2013 \u6cd5\u7c73\u901a\u767d\u91d1\u6bbf\u5802<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cA quiet tale like a trail in the snow, two forlorn souls seeking comfort in a dying world, and a slight touch of warmth. For a player like me, that's all I need.\u201d<br />\r\n\u904a\u6232\u6642\u5149VGtime<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cIf you like curling up with a good book as much as sitting down with a good game, Rocket of Whispers is a perfect way to spend an enjoyable afternoon.\u201d<br />\r\nNintendo Life<br />\r\n","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742250/ss_fa44fce91794d6abdbc056fc937051f940728375.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709176976","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742250/ss_fa44fce91794d6abdbc056fc937051f940728375.600x338.jpg?t=1709176976"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742250/ss_9dc5cfd7307346cc44fbcf4f7746cabc5857ee4b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709176976","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742250/ss_9dc5cfd7307346cc44fbcf4f7746cabc5857ee4b.600x338.jpg?t=1709176976"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742250/ss_beb136e0a64143e3b62cdb93e6826eb23de12643.1920x1080.jpg?t=1709176976","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/742250/ss_beb136e0a64143e3b62cdb93e6826eb23de12643.600x338.jpg?t=1709176976"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/7